      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُبِرٌّ</span></b>  One <i>who overcomes.</i> (TA.) [See 4.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِنَّهُ لَمُبِرٌّ بِذٰلِكَ</span> means <i>Verily he is a prudent,</i> or
<i>sound, manager of that;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَابِطٌ لَهُ</span>. (M, K. *)

